0 BEGIN PGM TL04 MM
1 ; WRITTEN FOR GEDIT - SYNTHETIC TEST PROGRAM, NOT FOR A MACHINE
2 * - TWO TOOL CALLS, SAME NUMBER, ONE NAMES ITS AXIS
3 TOOL CALL 4 Z S3000 F500
4 L Z+100 R0 FMAX M3
5 L Z-1 R0 F200
6 ; SAME NUMBER, WITH AN AXIS: A SISTER TOOL, A SECOND CALL
7 TOOL CALL 4 Z S7000 F350
8 L X+50 R0 F350
9 L Z+100 R0 FMAX M9
10 M30
11 END PGM TL04 MM
